if theres not a visutella parameter, the function for it is
Code:
Game_BattlerBase.prototype.paramBuffRate = function(paramId) {
    return this._buffs[paramId] * 0.25 + 1.0;
};
change the .25 to what you want, save it as a js file and add it to your project as a plugin
